   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_ZURI_06">Seefeldstrasse 73</name> <hi rend="superscript">III</hi>
                            </addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_ZURI">Zurich</name> VIII: <name type="geo" key="G_CHE">Switzerland</name>
                            </addrLine> </address>
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Dear <name type="person" key="weav76">Miss Weaver</name>: The editor of the <name type="work">
                            <hi rend="underline">Journal</hi> <hi rend="underline">de</hi>
                                <choice>
                                    <sic>
                                    <hi rend="underline">Génève</hi>
                                </sic>
                                    <corr>
                                    <hi rend="underline">Genève</hi>
                                </corr>
                                </choice>
                        </name> promises to consider <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">
                            <rs type="work" key="W_APORTRAIT">the book</rs>
                        </seg> for review. Will you please send him a copy and let me know when it is sent. You could also send one to the editor, <name type="work">
                            <hi rend="underline">Semaine</hi> 
                                <choice>
                                    <sic>
                                    <hi rend="underline">Litteraire</hi>
                                </sic>
                                    <corr>
                                    <hi rend="underline">Littéraire</hi>
                                </corr>
                                </choice>
                        </name>, 10 rue Petitot, <choice>
                            <sic>Génève</sic>
                            <corr>Genève</corr>
                        </choice>. I have written to the critic of the <name type="work">
                            <hi rend="underline">Revue</hi> <hi rend="underline">Suisse</hi>
                        </name> and meanwhile will try to get some wholesale bookseller to take on copies here.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>        	With kind regards</salute>
                        <salute>                    	sincerely yours</salute>
                        <signed>                                	<name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                        <dateline>
                            <date when="1917-07-19">19.7.917</date>
                        </dateline> </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">
                    <name type="work" key="W_APORTRAIT">A Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man</name>.</note>
            </div>
